OL,3,GNEWSADisgraced ex-Reform Wales leader
OL,4,Awho took pro-Russian bribes must pay
OL,5,A#22k
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe former leader of Reform UK in Wales
OL,8,Fhas been ordered to pay more than
OL,9,F#22,500 after accepting bribes to make
OL,10,Fpro-Russian speeches in the European
OL,11,FParliament.
OL,13,FNathan Gill, 53, of Llangefni on
OL,14,FAnglesey, was sentenced to
OL,15,F10-and-a-half years in prison in
OL,16,FNovember 2025 after pleading guilty to
OL,17,Feight counts of bribery under the
OL,18,FBribery Act 2010.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,438,430,260,140,0,100
