OL,3,GNEWSADisgraced ex-Reform Wales leader
OL,4,Awho took pro-Russian bribes must pay
OL,5,A#22k
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe is thought to have received up to
OL,8,F#40,000 to help pro-Russian politicians
OL,9,Fin Ukraine, while he was a Member of
OL,10,Fthe European Parliament (MEP).
OL,12,FAt the Old Bailey on Thursday he was
OL,13,Fgiven six months to sell a rental
OL,14,Fproperty to pay the money to the UK
OL,15,Fgovernment, or face a further nine
OL,16,Fmonths in prison.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
